    notes: "the preprint that SpotMAX's documentation asks users to cite (13 authors; the first and the last are shown)"
  - type: article
    title: "DeepFoci: Deep learning-based algorithm for fast automatic analysis of DNA double-strand break ionizing radiation-induced foci"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Vicar"
        given-names: "Tomas"
    year: 2021
    journal: "Computational and Structural Biotechnology Journal"
    volume: 19
    start: 6465
    end: 6480
    notes: "the study behind the real example's data"
  - type: data
    title: "Annotated DNA Double Strand Break Ionizing Radiation-Induced Foci (gH2AX 53BP1) Confocal Microscopy, pt. 1"
    authors:
